 ## Known Limitations and Deferred Work
 
 <a id="known-limitations-and-deferred-work"></a>
-- **Listing only.** No search, artifact filter, drag-and-drop, rename, context menu, current-file highlight, or filesystem watching; a level changes only through reload.
+- **Navigation and composer references only.** No search, artifact filter, directory drag, rename, context menu, current-file highlight, or filesystem watching; a level changes only through reload.
